### Sign up
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "soode@example.com", "password": "password123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Log in
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "soode@example.com", "password": "password123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Create a task
POST http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "My first private task", "date": "2026-10-07" }

### List my tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without token → should be 401
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks


### Reminder settings of the logged-in user
GET http://localhost:3000/reminder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a test push to my own devices
POST http://localhost:3000/push/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cron job: send due reminders (paste CRON_SECRET from .env here, never commit it)
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/send-reminders
X-Cron-Secret: paste-your-CRON_SECRET-here
